    "description": "<p>The Solar Exalted exist in a heroic mythological tradition that emphasizes the ability to endure great suffering and continue fighting regardless of how battered one's body is. The Solar warrior who could give no ground and would never fall from his wounds is an archetype common to many ancient stories. This Charm emulates that hero's legendary durability. Each purchase of this Charm grants the player one option from the following list:</p><ul><li>One -0 health level and two -2 health levels</li><li>Two -1 health levels</li></ul><p>A character may purchase this Charm once per dot of Resistance he possesses.</p>",
